DESCRIPTION:Join the Friends of the Nutley Public Library at the Dolores 
 Capalbo Book Sale. The Book Sale will be held on October 21\, 22\, 23 & 
 24.\n\nDonation Days will begin on October 17. We ask that you save and 
 hold onto the items you will be donating until we can accept them at the 
 Library on October 17\, 19 & 20.\n\nAll proceeds from the sale are used to 
 support the Nutley Public Library’s programs and collections. The Book 
 Sale has been one of the most successful fundraisers and we appreciate all 
 your support. For additional information\, please call 973-667-0405 
 x2604.\n\nDonation Days:\nOctober 17\, 19\, 20: 10:00 a.m. - 4:00 
 p.m.\n\nSale Days:\nOctober 21: 4:00 p.m. - 7:00 p.m. (Nutley Cardholders 
 Preview Sale Day)\nOctober 22: 10:00 a.m. - 7:00 p.m.\nOctober 23: 10:00 
 a.m. - 4:00 p.m.\nOctober 24: 10:00 a.m. - 4:00 p.m.\n\nLocation:\nNutley 
 Public Library\nStockton Room\n93 Booth Drive\nNutley\, NJ 
 07110\n973-667-0405\nlibrary@nutleynj.org
